(Personal Finance Basics: Budgeting) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A budget is a plan for where money goes, not a restriction on spending.) Tj
T*
(Track actual expenses for two to three months before setting targets,) Tj
T*
(otherwise the plan will be based on guesswork.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A common starting point is the 50/30/20 split of take-home pay:) Tj
T*
(50 percent for needs such as housing, food and transport,) Tj
T*
(30 percent for wants such as travel and hobbies,) Tj
T*
(20 percent for saving and debt repayment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The emergency fund should cover three to six months of essential expenses,) Tj
T*
(not three to six months of income. Keep it liquid and low volatility.) Tj
T*
() Tj
